  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transfer of FPI Cybersecurity Funds to INTPA - D4D Part II (ACT - 63012 &gt; ACT - 63080)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the action &#xbf;Transfer of FPI Cybersecurity Funds to INTPA - D4D Hub Part II (ACT-63012 &#xbf; ACT-63080)&#xbf;, resources initially programmed under FPI to reduce global threats to maritime security and cybersecurity and to support the EU Cybersecurity Strategy for the Digital Decade (2020) are transferred to DG INTPA.These funds, notably from Component 2 - EU CyberNet Plus, which aims to strengthen global cyber capacity through international cooperation and extend the EU CyberNet project beyond 2026, will reinforce cybersecurity-related activities and digital cooperation within the D4D Hub Part Il framework (ACT-63080).</narrative>
  </description>
